  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Replace&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Eliminating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>log</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>log</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>18</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>",
